# Cesium Ion access token, used only by Storybook.
#
# Optional. Without it the stories fall back to Cesium's bundled offline
# Natural Earth II imagery and no terrain, which is what CI runs against. That
# texture has no detail left at the zoom levels the stories draw at, so it is
# hard to tell where anything is being drawn.
#
# With a token every story renders Cesium World Imagery instead, and the
# terrain stories additionally render Cesium World Terrain, which is what you
# want when checking drawing on tilted, mountainous ground.
CESIUM_ION_ACCESS_TOKEN=
